message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: >-
  SimKit - team helper for STAR-CCM+ cases
abstract: >-
  STAR-CCM+ Java macros that keep the native workflow and add generated case identity,
  versioned saves with set-up records, a pre-run check, results export, standard reports
  and scenes, a mesh study helper, a case tracker and engineering calculators.
type: software
version: "0.3"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jabnit/simkit"
keywords:
  - STAR-CCM+
  - CFD
  - simulation workflow
  - macros
